@startuml
actor User
participant FITOM_X
participant PatchEditor

User -> FITOM_X: double-click Bank/Program in MIDI monitor
FITOM_X -> PatchEditor: launch as a separate process\nargs: <profile.json> <kind> <bank-file> <prog>
PatchEditor -> FITOM_X: connect to named pipe / UNIX domain socket
FITOM_X -> PatchEditor: channel assignment SysEx\nF0 00 48 01 03 <ch> F7
PatchEditor -> FITOM_X: CC#0=0x79 (make <ch> a melody channel)
PatchEditor -> FITOM_X: CC#0=<VoicePatchType> / CC#32=<HwBank> / Prog.chg <HwProg>

@enduml